{
  "title": "Bilateral imbalance in stride-time variability: inconclusive incremental prediction across public gait collections",
  "abstract": "Bilateral stride-CV imbalance showed no established incremental Parkinson/control prediction: second-collection logloss 0.403740 versus 0.401788, delta -0.001952, joint-bootstrap95% interval [-0.044516,0.030846]; AUC unchanged. This is an exploratory cross-collection result, not untouched or verified independent-participant confirmation.",
